          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 881,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:1",
          "start": 866
        },
        "quote": "(b) Amendments.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "6fcf2d8a-23d0-55db-8772-3d775dd1eb72",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 981,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:2",
          "start": 882
        },
        "quote": "(1) Section 10.6, relating to bows and arrows, is hereby amended by adding the following exception:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "cc89d2f3-9d91-5e3b-b39c-852dafdfc8ad",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1096,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:3",
          "start": 982
        },
        "quote": "Exception: Operation of a bow and arrow is permitted in accordance with the provisions set forth in TMC 6.05.110 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "ed97511c-f2f4-5e1e-ad03-a677f1af277b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1268,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:4",
          "start": 1097
        },
        "quote": "(2) Section 5.7, relating to selling, giving or furnishing cigarettes or tobacco products to a minor, is hereby deleted and the following language is substituted therefor:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "e62e92ff-57c8-5a2b-ba04-062c604454c8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1312,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:5",
          "start": 1269
        },
        "quote": "(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "9d9191e0-3189-5858-bad5-7cb767b67920",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1455,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:6",
          "start": 1313
        },
        "quote": "(1) Sell, furnish or distribute cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine to any person under 21 years of age; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "98d8b756-b389-58af-a9b3-260af6fe75ed",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1576,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:7",
          "start": 1456
        },
        "quote": "(2) Buy any cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine for any person under 21 years of age.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "cbc86653-710f-5a6b-b97f-79c5f256692a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1642,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:8",
          "start": 1577
        },
        "quote": "(b) It shall be a defense to a prosecution under this section if:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "9baa001d-2d38-5474-a19a-73449aea275e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1763,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:9",
          "start": 1643
        },
        "quote": "(1) The defendant is a licensed retail dealer, or employee thereof, or a person authorized by law to distribute samples;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "c99e164d-4470-5131-92b2-c5407b2b25d5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2084,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:10",
          "start": 1764
        },
        "quote": "(2) The defendant sold, furnished or distributed the cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products, or liquid nicotine to the person under 21 years of age with reasonable cause to believe the person was of legal age to purchase or receive cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "a2f05b04-b5fb-5cc7-b10c-8b24c26682f8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2551,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:11",
          "start": 2085
        },
        "quote": "(3) To purchase or receive the cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine, the person under 21 years of age exhibited to the defendant a driver’s license, Kansas non driver’s identification card or other official or apparently official document containing a photograph of the person and purporting to establish that the person was of legal age to purchase or receive cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "2f36b1cf-cec6-519f-ba79-8db261907ff0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2919,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:12",
          "start": 2552
        },
        "quote": "(4) For purposes of this section the person who violates this section shall be the individual directly selling, furnishing or distributing the cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine to any person under 21 years of age or the retail dealer who has actual knowledge of such selling, furnishing or distributing by such individual or both.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "7fb03564-c420-5456-808e-c937f4cef543",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2988,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:13",
          "start": 2920
        },
        "quote": "(c) It shall be a defense to a prosecution under this subsection if:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "fa5c6b7d-d265-50a2-a686-9b4bd6dd6e9b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3148,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:14",
          "start": 2989
        },
        "quote": "(1) The defendant engages in the lawful sale, furnishing or distribution of cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine by mail; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "1f28ecf8-51a8-507d-a914-f12750611948",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3467,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:15",
          "start": 3149
        },
        "quote": "(2) The defendant sold, furnished or distributed the cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine to the person by mail only after the person had provided to the defendant an unsworn declaration, conforming to K.S.A. 53-601 and amendments thereto, that the person was 21 or more years of age.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "ed28860b-0326-5295-abd2-2f7765d29829",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4020,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:16",
          "start": 3468
        },
        "quote": "(d) The words and phrases in Section 5.7 shall have the same meanings as defined in K.S.A. 79-3301 , and amendments thereto. “Liquid nicotine” shall mean the active ingredient of the tobacco plant (nicotine) in liquefied form suitable for the induction of nicotine, whether by nasal spray, ingestion, smoking or other means, into the human body. “Sale” shall mean any transfer of title or possession or both, exchange, barter, distribution or gift of cigarettes, electronic cigarettes, tobacco products or liquid nicotine with or without consideration.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "418b4b8e-1413-5509-8ca6-81f326fc388d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4125,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:17",
          "start": 4021
        },
        "quote": "(e) Violation of this section shall constitute a Class B violation punishable by a minimum fine of $200.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "c1ff88cc-1c0d-53a3-8beb-fcae7a1c84a8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4356,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:18",
          "start": 4126
        },
        "quote": "(3) Sections 10.24 (“Smoking Prohibited”), 10.25 (“Smoking; Posting Premises”), 10.26 (“Smoking Prohibited; Penalties”) are hereby omitted and deleted and the provisions set forth in Chapter 8.20 TMC shall be substituted therefor.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.05.080 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "e540158c-5ee4-5840-bea4-9c8a2d01a017",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4530,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:19",
          "start": 4357
        },
        "quote": "(4) Section 11.11 (“Cruelty to Animals”) is hereby omitted and deleted and the provisions set forth in TMC 6.05.100 shall be substituted therefor. (Ord. 20588 § 1, 8-12-25.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.05.080:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
